rule LineOeeTarget
	lineageTag: de05337f-9b87-5701-a713-ad764f3775d3
	statement: Each line is measured against its own OEE target (OeeTarget.target_oee), which can change from the Power BI report. The site commits to at least 75% OEE; 85% or higher is world-class; below 60% requires action.

	ruleReferencedEntity production#OeeTarget
		propertyScope: specific
		ruleReferencedProperty target_oee

	ruleReferencedEntity equipment#ProductionLine

	ruleReferencedRelationship production#TargetForLine
